What this covers
----------------

CC BY 4.0 applies to the SHACL shape data:

  - <Name>/index.json    — each type's SHACL NodeShape (JSON-LD)
  - corpus.jsonl         — generated: every shape as one record per line
  - index.json           — generated: name → shape URL
  - reverse-index.json   — generated: urn:solid type → shape URL

What this does NOT cover
------------------------

Build scripts remain licensed under AGPL-3.0 (see LICENSE):

  - scripts/*.js
  - top-level index.html

Why
---

SHACL shapes are graph contracts — designed to be embedded in any
validator (SHACL or otherwise) that checks RDF data. CC BY 4.0 means a
shape for urn:solid:Person can be dropped into a proprietary system
with attribution but without inheriting copyleft.
